        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: બીવું",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "બીવું — bīvũ — \"to be scared\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "નાની બહેન અંધારામાં બીએ છે. nānī bahen andhārāmā̃ bīe che. My little sister is scared of the dark."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): તે બીધો, te bīdho."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "બીવું (bīvũ) is inherited from Sanskrit bibhēti, \"fears\"; CDIAL lists the Gujarati verb (CDIAL 9241). The noun બીક (bīk), \"fear\", belongs to the same family."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
